# Global Types Consolidation Plan

## Goal

Move **shared domain and UI types** into a single module (`src/types/index.ts`) so unions, game state shapes, and cross-file duplicates live in one place. Easier to find, rename, and keep consistent as the codebase grows.

**Status:** Not started — plan only, no code changes yet.

---

## Current State (inventory)

Types are scattered across ~12 locations. Several are **duplicated** or **near-duplicates**.

### Exported types (public API today)

| Symbol | Location | Used by |
|--------|----------|---------|
| `Vec` | `game/physics.ts` | physics, overlays, engine |
| `Marble` | `game/physics.ts` | views, overlays, physics |
| `BoardDimensions` | `game/boardLayout.ts` | views, layout |
| `Settings` | `context/SettingsContext.tsx` | settings screen, views, constants wiring |
| `Lang` | `i18n.ts` | all UI |
| `GameMode` | `components/IntroScreen.tsx` | `App.tsx`, intro |
| `AiLevel`, `AiProfile`, `ShotPlan`, `Pt`, `MarblePos`, `BilliardsAiInput`, `FourBallAiInput` | `game/ai/types.ts` | AI module, settings, views |
| `Wall` | `game/ai/geometry.ts` | AI geometry only |

### Duplicated / inline types (should centralize)

| Symbol | Locations | Issue |
|--------|-----------|-------|
| `SpinType` | `BilliardsView.tsx`, `FourBallView.tsx` | identical `'draw' \| 'stop' \| 'follow'` inside each component |
| `EnglishType` | `BilliardsView.tsx`, `FourBallView.tsx` | identical `'left' \| 'none' \| 'right'` |
| `AimState` | `TrajectoryLine.tsx`, `MagnifierOverlay.tsx` | identical `{ startX, startY, x, y }` |
| `ChargeDir` | `TrajectoryLine.tsx`, `MagnifierOverlay.tsx` | identical `{ dx, dy, mag }` |
| `Pt` vs `Vec` | `game/ai/types.ts` vs `game/physics.ts` | same shape `{ x: number; y: number }`, different names |
| `language` field | `Settings.language?: 'ko' \| 'en'` | should use `Lang` instead of inline union |

### Module-private types (keep local unless shared)

| Symbol | Location | Notes |
|--------|----------|-------|
| `Candidate`, `RouteKind`, `FirstBall` | `game/ai/billiardsAi.ts` | planner internals — **do not** move to global |
| `Candidate`, `ShotKind` | `game/ai/fourBallAi.ts` | planner internals |
| `Props` | each component | colocate unless identical across files |
| `SettingsContextValue` | `SettingsContext.tsx` | context-only; optional export from global |
| `IconName` | `IconButton.tsx` | derived from Ionicons — keep local |

### Missing typed unions (inline today)

| Concept | Current usage | Proposed name |
|---------|---------------|---------------|
| 3-Cushion turn | `1 \| 2` in `BilliardsView` | `BilliardsTurn` |
| 4-Ball turn | `'yellow' \| 'white'` in `FourBallView` | `FourBallTurn` |
| 4-Ball winner | `'yellow' \| 'white' \| null` | `FourBallWinner` |
| 3-Cushion winner | `1 \| 2 \| null` | `BilliardsWinner` |
| i18n keys | `t(lang, key: string)` | `TranslationKey` (optional Phase 2) |

