## Target Architecture

### Single entry point

```
src/types/
  index.ts    — all shared types + type-only re-exports (no runtime values)
```

**Import convention after migration:**

```ts
import type { Settings, Lang, SpinType, Marble } from '../types';
// or path alias (optional): import type { Settings } from '@/types';
```

### What lives in `src/types/index.ts`

Organized by section comments (one file, logical groups):

```ts
// ── Primitives ──────────────────────────────────
export type Point = { x: number; y: number };   // replaces Vec + Pt

// ── i18n ────────────────────────────────────────
export type Lang = 'en' | 'ko';
export type TranslationKey = keyof typeof STRINGS.en; // after i18n refactor

// ── App / navigation ─────────────────────────────
export type GameMode = 'billiards' | 'billiards-ai' | '4ball' | '4ball-ai';

// ── Settings ────────────────────────────────────
export interface Settings { … }

// ── Game / physics ──────────────────────────────
export interface Marble { … }
export interface BoardDimensions { … }

// ── Shot technique (shared by both game views) ───
export type SpinType = 'draw' | 'stop' | 'follow';
export type EnglishType = 'left' | 'none' | 'right';

// ── Turn / winner ───────────────────────────────
export type BilliardsTurn = 1 | 2;
export type FourBallTurn = 'yellow' | 'white';
…

// ── Overlays / aiming ───────────────────────────
export interface AimState { … }
export interface ChargeDir { … }

// ── AI (public planner API) ─────────────────────
export type AiLevel = …
export interface AiProfile { … }
…

// ── AI geometry (if used outside ai/) ───────────
export interface Wall { … }   // only if still imported outside ai/
```

### What stays outside `src/types/`

| Item | Stays in | Reason |
|------|----------|--------|
| `PhysicsEngine` class | `game/physics.ts` | runtime + methods |
| `AI_PROFILES`, constants | `game/constants.ts`, `game/ai/profiles.ts` | runtime values |
| Component `Props` | component files | unless identical (e.g. future shared `GameViewProps`) |
| AI `Candidate` types | `billiardsAi.ts`, `fourBallAi.ts` | implementation detail |

### Deprecation / alias strategy

During migration, avoid a big-bang break:

1. Add `src/types/index.ts` with canonical names.
2. **`Point` replaces `Vec` and `Pt`** — temporary aliases in old files:
   ```ts
   /** @deprecated use Point from src/types */
   export type Vec = Point;
   ```
3. Update imports file-by-file; remove aliases when grep shows zero usages.
4. Delete `game/ai/types.ts` after re-exporting from `src/types` for one PR or removing entirely.

