## Acceptance Criteria

- [ ] `src/types/index.ts` exists and documents all shared types in grouped sections
- [ ] Zero duplicate `SpinType`, `EnglishType`, `AimState`, `ChargeDir` definitions
- [ ] Single `Point` type replaces `Vec` and `Pt`
- [ ] `Settings`, `Lang`, `GameMode`, AI public types imported from `src/types` everywhere
- [ ] `game/ai/types.ts` removed (or thin re-export deprecated one release)
- [ ] `import type` used for type-only imports (no runtime circular deps)
- [ ] `npx tsc --noEmit` passes
- [ ] No game logic or behaviour changes — types-only refactor

